         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_3464da3f-29bf-09f7-e054-00144ff8d46c">
               <id root="0b646263-6d54-0664-e063-6294a90a166c"/>
               <code code="42229-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">How to Use to get Natural-Looking Color:</content> For best results, use daily as your facial moisturizer. Apply a generous amount evenly over freshly cleansed face, blending into jawline &amp; hairline and avoiding eyebrows. Allow several minutes for it to fully absorb. Wash your hands after application. You will begin to see a subtle development of color within days. If color change is not as noticeable as desired, apply more frequently.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20231129"/>
            </section>
